{"chapter": "guide", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "03B6", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:82c3b9c37008a446e9bde6593a7c71dd34c26094e297bc16c1e974920f39c39f", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nBelow is a list of research papers which contain fundamental results on stacks\nand algebraic spaces. The intention of the summaries is to indicate only the\nresults of the paper which contribute toward stack theory; in many cases these\nresults are subsidiary to the main goals of the paper. We divide the papers\ninto categories with some papers falling into multiple categories.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:93ff2e191112205fb300d87bf69e83949ecf6f55cf39092ee803ffd96edb6c7c", "unit_id": "tag:03B6:paragraph-0001"}
